notification_templates.body_template:
Dear {{student_name}},

Your payment of {{currency}}{{amount}} was due on {{due_date}} and is now {{days_overdue}} days overdue.

Original Amount: {{currency}}{{original_amount}}
Late Fee Applied: {{currency}}{{late_fee}}
Total Due: {{currency}}{{total_due}}

Please make payment immediately to avoid further penalties and potential holds on your student account.

If you are experiencing financial difficulties, please contact our finance office to discuss payment options.

Best regards,
University Finance Office

Dear {{student_name}},

Thank you for your payment. This email confirms receipt of your payment.

Payment Details:
Amount: {{currency}}{{amount}}
Payment Method: {{payment_method}}
Transaction ID: {{transaction_id}}
Receipt Number: {{receipt_number}}
Payment Date: {{payment_date}}

Your updated account balance is: {{currency}}{{account_balance}}

Please keep this email for your records.

Best regards,
University Finance Office

Dear {{student_name}},

Your payment plan has been successfully created.

Plan Details:
Plan Type: {{plan_name}}
Total Amount: {{currency}}{{total_amount}}
Number of Installments: {{installments}}
First Payment Due: {{first_due_date}}
Installment Amount: {{currency}}{{installment_amount}}

Payment Schedule:
{{payment_schedule}}

Please ensure timely payments to avoid late fees.

Best regards,
University Finance Office

Dear {{student_name}},

This is a reminder that your payment plan installment is due soon.

Installment Details:
Plan: {{plan_name}}
Installment #: {{installment_number}} of {{total_installments}}
Amount Due: {{currency}}{{amount}}
Due Date: {{due_date}}

Remaining Balance: {{currency}}{{remaining_balance}}

Please ensure your payment is submitted on time.

Best regards,
University Finance Office

Dear {{student_name}},

Congratulations! We are pleased to inform you that you have been awarded the {{scholarship_name}}.

Award Details:
Scholarship: {{scholarship_name}}
Amount: {{currency}}{{amount}}
Academic Year: {{academic_year}}

This award will be applied to your student account.

If you have any questions, please contact the Financial Aid Office.

Best regards,
University Financial Aid Office

Dear {{student_name}},

Your financial aid has been disbursed to your student account.

Disbursement Details:
Aid Type: {{aid_type}}
Amount Disbursed: {{currency}}{{amount}}
Disbursement Date: {{disbursement_date}}

Your updated account balance is: {{currency}}{{account_balance}}

If you have any questions about your financial aid, please contact the Financial Aid Office.

Best regards,
University Financial Aid Office

Dear {{student_name}},

Your refund request has been processed.

Refund Details:
Refund Amount: {{currency}}{{amount}}
Refund Method: {{refund_method}}
Reference Number: {{reference_number}}
